    {
      "source": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Exception.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Exception</a></code> - this method can handle or propagate exceptions; see class-level\nJavadoc for details.",
      "translation": "<code><a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.oracle.com/en/java/javase/17/docs/api/java.base/java/lang/Exception.html\" title=\"class or interface in java.lang\">Exception</a></code> - 此方法可以处理或传播异常；有关详细信息，请参阅类级别的 Javadoc。",
      "count": 3
    },
    {
      "source": "Methods in this class allow exceptions from the wrapped <a href=\"../../../WebSocketHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket\"><code>WebSocketHandler</code></a> to\npropagate. However, any exceptions resulting from SockJS message handling (for example, while\nsending SockJS frames or heartbeat messages) are caught and treated as transport\nerrors, i.e. routed to the\n<a href=\"../../../WebSocketHandler.html#handleTransportError(org.springframework.web.socket.WebSocketSession,java.lang.Throwable)\"><code>handleTransportError</code></a> method of the wrapped handler and the session closed.",
      "translation": "该类中的方法允许来自包装的 <a href=\"../../../WebSocketHandler.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.web.socket\"><code>WebSocketHandler</code></a> 的异常传播。然而，任何由 SockJS 消息处理（例如在发送 SockJS 帧或心跳消息时）产生的异常都会被捕获并视为传输错误，即路由到包装处理器的 <a href=\"../../../WebSocketHandler.html#handleTransportError(org.springframework.web.socket.WebSocketSession,java.lang.Throwable)\"><code>handleTransportError</code></a> 方法，并关闭会话。",
      "count": 2
    },
